<title>INDIA: Fire disrupts work at ABN Amro Bombay office.</title>
<headline>Fire disrupts work at ABN Amro Bombay office.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fire erupted in Dalamal House building at Bombay's busy Nariman Point business district, a fire brigade official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a minor fire due to short-circuit,&quot; the official told Reuters. He said employees are not being evacuated and the fire was under control.</p>
<p>An official of ABN Amro Bank, which is housed in the building, said the bank had suspended some operations but were expected to resume them soon.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
